t of the different categories of status codes returned by the Vatly API. Use these to understand if a request was successful.",[483,484,485,498],"table",{},[486,487,488],"thead",{},[489,490,491,495],"tr",{},[492,493,494],"th",{},"Status",[492,496,497],{},"Description",[499,500,501,513,523],"tbody",{},[489,502,503,510],{},[504,505,506],"td",{},[507,508,509],"code",{},"2xx",[504,511,512],{},"A 2xx status code indicates a successful response.",[489,514,515,520],{},[504,516,517],{},[507,518,519],{},"4xx",[504,521,522],{},"A 4xx status code indicates a client error. This means there's an issue with the request.",[489,524,525,530],{},[504,526,527],{},[507,528,529],{},"5xx",[504,531,532],{},"A 5xx status code indicates a server error. This means the issue is on Vatly's end and we are automatically notified of the problem.",[534,535,537],"h3",{"id":536},"common-status-codes","Common status codes",[483,539,540,550],{},[486,541,542],{},[489,543,544,547],{},[492,545,546],{},"Code",[492,548,549],{},"Meaning",[499,551,552,562,572,582,592,602,612,622,632,646,656],{},[489,553,554,559],{},[504,555,556],{},[507,557,558],{},"200",[504,560,561],{},"OK - Request succeeded.",[489,563,564,569],{},[504,565,566],{},[507,567,568],{},"201",[504,570,571],{},"Created - Resource was successfully created.",[489,573,574,579],{},[504,575,576],{},[507,577,578],{},"204",[504,580,581],{},"No Content - Request succeeded with no response body (e.g., deletes).",[489,583,584,589],{},[504,585,586],{},[507,587,588],{},"400",[504,590,591],{},"Bad Request - The request was malformed.",[489,593,594,599],{},[504,595,596],{},[507,597,598],{},"401",[504,600,601],{},"Unauthorized - Invalid or missing API key.",[489,603,604,609],{},[504,605,606],{},[507,607,608],{},"403",[504,610,611],{},"Forbidden - The API key doesn't have permission for this action.",[489,613,614,619],{},[504,615,616],{},[507,617,618],{},"404",[504,620,621],{},"Not Found - The requested resource doesn't exist.",[489,623,624,629],{},[504,625,626],{},[507,627,628],{},"409",[504,630,631],{},"Conflict - Idempotency mismatch, request still in progress, outcome unknown, a concurrent write, or a refund of the same order already being created.",[489,633,634,639],{},[504,635,636],{},[507,637,638],{},"422",[504,640,641,642,645],{},"Unprocessable Entity - Validation failed. Check the ",[507,643,644],{},"errors"," field for details.",[489,647,648,653],{},[504,649,650],{},[507,651,652],{},"429",[504,654,655],{},"Too Many Requests - Rate limit exceeded. Slow down your requests.",[489,657,658,663],{},[504,659,660],{},[507,661,662],{},"500",[504,664,665],{},"Internal Server Error - Something went wrong on Vatly's end.",[472,667],{},[475,669,671],{"id":670},"error-responses","Error responses",[468,673,674],{},"Whenever a request is unsuccessful, the Vatly API will return an error response with a human-readable message. Combine it with the HTTP status code to understand what has gone wrong and how to fix it. Most of the error messages are pretty helpful and actionable.",[676,677,683],"pre",{"className":678,"code":679,"filename":680,"language":681,"meta":682,"style":682},"language-json shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","{\n  \"message\": \"Resource not found.\"\n}\n","Error response","json","",[507,684,685,694,720],{"__ignoreMap":682},[686,687,690],"span",{"class":688,"line":689},"line",1,[686,691,693],{"class":692},"sMK4o","{\n",[686,695,697,700,704,707,710,713,717],{"class":688,"line":696},2,[686,698,699],{"class":692},"  \"",[686,701,703],{"class":702},"spNyl","message",[686,705,706],{"class":692},"\"",[686,708,709],{"class":692},":",[686,711,712],{"class":692}," \"",[686,714,716],{"class":715},"sfazB","Resource not found.",[686,718,719],{"class":692},"\"\n",[686,721,723],{"class":688,"line":722},3,[686,724,725],{"class":692},"}\n",[468,727,728,729,732,733,735],{},"Some errors also include an optional ",[507,730,731],{},"details"," object with structured context about the 